## 6. How to run (local)

```bash
cd simple_mlops_pipeline
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate    # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python pipeline.py
```

**Expected stdout:** four bracketed stage lines ending in `Done.`

**Rerun behavior:** Overwrites the same four artifact files in `artifacts/` (no versioning folders yet).

