## 11. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Likely cause | What to do |
|---------|----------------|------------|
| `ModuleNotFoundError: sklearn` | venv not activated or deps not installed | `pip install -r requirements.txt` |
| ConvergenceWarning from LogisticRegression | `max_iter` too low for harder data | Increase `max_iter` or tune `C` / solver. |
| Different accuracy on two laptops | Different sklearn/numpy builds | Lock dependencies; compare `run_manifest.json` `python` + `pip freeze`. |
| `joblib.load` fails on deploy | Train / serve sklearn mismatch | Align versions or export to ONNX for serve-side independence. |
| Empty `artifacts/` | Run failed before write | Check traceback; ensure write permissions to project dir. |

