## 12. Roadmap to “real” MLOps (same stages, harder infra)

| Stage | Production-oriented upgrade |
|-------|-----------------------------|
| Prepare | Read from warehouse / S3 / Delta; validate schema with **pandera** or **Great Expectations**; write dataset version URI. |
| Train | **MLflow** / **W&B** tracking; hyperparameter search; GPU training; distributed frameworks. |
| Evaluate | Holdout + cross-validation; fairness metrics; calibration curves; export reports to HTML/PDF. |
| Manifest | Model registry (**MLflow Model Registry**, SageMaker, Vertex); **sign** artifacts; store **SBOM** + docker digest. |
| Orchestration | **Airflow**, **Prefect**, **Dagster**, **Argo Workflows**, **Kubeflow Pipelines**. |
| Deploy | **FastAPI** + `joblib.load` at startup, or **TorchServe** / **Triton** if you change model format; **canary** via traffic split. |

